  "why": "A white plane on an asphalt runway in an open field, built up piece by piece (wings, engine, curved wing, tail, hinged rudder and elevator, flaps, door). Close shots on the engine, wing and tail when they change, the whole plane for take-off and the outlines from the first word of their lines.",
